.TH "FPS-COUNTER" "1" "2026-11-06" "Homelab ops"
.SH NAME
fps-counter \- Report the display refresh-rate based status used by the desktop.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fps-counter
[arguments]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report the display refresh-rate based status used by the desktop.
Established names and consumer paths are preserved. No hardware or service action was executed for documentation verification.
